# gruvbox-dark: yew adaptation of Gruvbox's palette.
# Palette: https://github.com/morhetz/gruvbox
# UI role mappings and subtle diff tints are yew adaptations.
#
# The MIT License (MIT)
# 
# Copyright (c) morhetz
# 
